         rack-mounted units, each with a status LED. Reads as machines/infra,
         not human health. LEDs are filled with the launcher background colour
         (#E65100) so they read as holes punched through the white units.
         Only a 66dp circle of the 108dp canvas is sure to show: drawn at full
         size the cabinet's corners sit ~41dp from the centre and its top and
         bottom edges at 34.5dp, so the circle cut them; at 0.76 the corners sit
         ~31dp out. -->
